PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52ZB

   1 a 0000 E52ZB: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006    /* E2E-52/P3-13 probe ZB (PLAN P3-13 H-2/H-4): product
   3 a 0006       scale 0 vs FORMAL scale 2, formal precision 7:
